[00:20.31]<00:20.31>Veget ert a nyar,
[00:24.00]<00:24.00>a strand is ures mar,
[00:27.69]<00:27.69>az uszomester is alszik,
[00:31.38]<00:31.38>semmit nem csinal,
[00:35.08]<00:35.08>Veget ert a nyar,
[00:38.77]<00:38.77>a nap se forro mar,
[00:42.46]<00:42.46>A langossuto elment,
[00:46.15]<00:46.15>a bazar is bezart...
